        <mxCell id="arch-A-hdr" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;A. Constructing a smooth latent space using a transformer-based VAE&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;A variational auto-encoder learns peptide representations with self-attention and reconstructs the sequence. The latent is deliberately &lt;b&gt;property-agnostic&lt;/b&gt;; a length head supplies the length the decode is truncated to.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
