        <mxCell id="arch-B-hdr" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;B. Conditional latent diffusion on the VAE latent space&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The denoiser is a &lt;b&gt;residual MLP with adaLN-Zero.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;It predicts the &lt;b&gt;clean latent&lt;/b&gt;, and conditions are randomly masked, which makes classifier-free guidance possible.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
